<title>POLAND: Polifarb-W Q4 net loss falls to PLN 0.2 m.</title>
<headline>Polifarb-W Q4 net loss falls to PLN 0.2 m.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polifarb Wroclaw results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.15 vs     0.03 loss</p>
